    "transcript": "What's better for your skin? CeraVe or Cetaphil? Well, we're about to find out because over the next couple weeks, I'll be putting this to the test by using only CeraVe on one side of my face and Cetaphil on the other. I don't know about you, but for the longest time, I thought they were part of the same company, but turns out they're not. CeraVe is owned by beauty conglomerate L'Oreal, and Cetaphil is owned by Valderma Laboratories, a Swiss pharmaceutical company. Both brands target people with sensitive skin. However, I'm really curious if we'll notice any difference between the two sides of my face by the end of this experiment. So stay tuned for the final result.",
    "transcriptChunks": [
      {
        "startSeconds": 0.022,
        "endSeconds": 2.663,
        "text": "What's better for your skin? CeraVe or Cetaphil?"
      },
      {
        "startSeconds": 2.763,
        "endSeconds": 4.822,
        "text": "Well, we're about to find out because over the next couple weeks,"
      },
      {
        "startSeconds": 4.923,
        "endSeconds": 9.663,
        "text": "I'll be putting this to the test by using only CeraVe on one side of my face and Cetaphil on the other."
      },
      {
        "startSeconds": 9.763,
        "endSeconds": 12.503,
        "text": "I don't know about you, but for the longest time, I thought they were part of the same company,"
      },
      {
        "startSeconds": 12.663,
        "endSeconds": 13.603,
        "text": "but turns out they're not."
      },
      {
        "startSeconds": 13.743,
        "endSeconds": 15.343,
        "text": "CeraVe is owned by beauty conglomerate L'Oreal,"
      },
      {
        "startSeconds": 15.603,
        "endSeconds": 19.183,
        "text": "and Cetaphil is owned by Valderma Laboratories, a Swiss pharmaceutical company."
      },
      {
        "startSeconds": 19.303,
        "endSeconds": 21.043,
        "text": "Both brands target people with sensitive skin."
      },
      {
        "startSeconds": 21.242,
        "endSeconds": 25.803,
        "text": "However, I'm really curious if we'll notice any difference between the two sides of my face by the end of this experiment."
      },
      {
        "startSeconds": 26.043,
        "endSeconds": 27.742,
        "text": "So stay tuned for the final result."
      }
    ],
